00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Sausage Party is a adventure, animation, comedy film directed by Greg Tiernan.

3
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:27,000
Hot dog Frank leads a group of supermarket products on a quest to discover the truth about their
existence and what really happens when they become chosen to leave the grocery store.

4
